Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:05.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Then, would you like to try going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:09.50,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:11.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No, my bad. Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:14.17,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,...is probably what he's \Ngoing to say to brush me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:15.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:21.79,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? That's sort of not... \Nthe reaction I was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:24.87,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I mean, how far do \Nyou want to take this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:26.88,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,How... far?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:31.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, y'know... like holding hands, \Nhugging, having sex...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.55,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Se—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:35.80,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Se— Sexual activities are \Nout of the question!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:37.45,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,She rephrased it...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.45,0:00:40.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then how far? Kissing? Holding hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:42.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,W-Well... that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:44.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,'Cause if we don't do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:46.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,the "experiment" doesn't mean much, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.85,0:00:49.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Y-You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:52.81,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? Does that mean I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.21,0:00:56.14,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,suggested something\NI'm not ready for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:59.62,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hold on! Please let me \Nthink about it for a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.94,0:01:04.20,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Who gets that red from \Nthe word "sex" these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:09.37,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:42.01,Default,KOTOBUKI; NOBARA,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:45.22,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Just how in the world could \Nsomething like that happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.49,0:02:46.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please don't say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.71,0:02:50.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm well aware that I'm the \None who's acting strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:55.52,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I just... I really thought \Nhe was just kidding, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:59.81,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sure I was just feeling frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.61,0:03:03.82,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It always seems like I end up playing\Ninto his hands before I realize it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:07.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,So I wanted to see how he'd react.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:11.96,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Even if just for a moment, \Nto see him flustered for once...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:16.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Why did I agree to it \Nbefore thinking it through?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:21.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I never imagined...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:24.39,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,that I'd actually end up dating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:26.22,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\bord0.25\t(0,588,\fs40)\b1\shad1.5\fade(171,0)\c&HE8D1FA&\frz11.71\move(334.667,260,320,226.666,0,588)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.71,0:03:26.22,Default,KOTOBUKI; NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:28.93,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan, you seemed \Nkinda girly just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:30.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:32.89,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Now, now. What's wrong with \Njust casually dating him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.89,0:03:35.80,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Yep, yep. It must have been meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:42.86,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,There's so much talk about\N "meant to be" and "fate" lately, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:41.40,top,FEMALE STUDENT A,0,0,0,,No way, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:42.86,top,FEMALE STUDENT B,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:44.83,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:47.41,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm getting a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:48.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoi Takiguichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.21,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:54.67,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And now there's more of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:03:57.56,Default,FEMALE STUDENT A,0,0,0,,What, Takiguichi-san again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.56,0:04:00.14,top,FEMALE STUDENT B,0,0,0,,Do you think something's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:00.84,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:02.39,Default,WHISPERING GIRL 1,0,0,0,,I wonder what they're gonna talk about!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.39,0:04:04.43,Default,WHISPERING GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Right? I'm so curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.65,0:04:08.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I've had quite enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.47,0:04:11.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Could you please stop \Ncoming to my classroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:12.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The other girls are staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And it seems there's more of you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:16.30,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,'Sup, I'm Sentaro Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:17.56,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,I'm Shun Kuwabatake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:18.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:21.56,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Nobara and Kotobuki, \Nwhy are you guys here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:24.32,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Huh?! Well, it seemed like you \Nguys were having fun, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:25.70,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Just getting the tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:27.95,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Are you Yoi-chan's friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.53,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,I-I'm Kotobuki Hibiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.53,0:04:33.91,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I'm Nobara Tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:37.20,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:38.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:40.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I got you guys memorized now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:42.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Fubuki-chan and Sumire-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:44.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:50.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, what happened to you thinking \Nthings over about us dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:53.59,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What? What's this about, for real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:53.72,top,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you for that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:54.81,overlaptop,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Makes my heart flutter when he's direct!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:53.72,overlap,SENTARO,0,0,0,,You guys are gonna go out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:55.85,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Could you all please keep it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:05:00.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Regarding that matter, I gave it\N some thought overnight.
