Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:09.26,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,and Yoi Takiguichi, who will \Nbe referred to as "YT,"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:12.37,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,would hereby adhere to the following \Nconditions and agreement.
