Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:16.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,One, KI and YT shall establish \Na romantic relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.78,0:05:20.04,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,on an experimental basis for \Napproximately two weeks to a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:35.00,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,708)\b1\fnTimes New Roman\an3\fs11\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HEEEBEC&\clip(1,24,640,33)\t(0,6304,\clip(1,24,640,74))\pos(331,74)}Two, KI and YT must keep\Ntheir romantic relationship\Nconcealed and not disclose it\Nto any third party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:24.41,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Two, KI and YT must keep their \Nromantic relationship concealed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.41,0:05:26.68,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,and not disclose it to any third party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:35.00,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,708)\b1\fnTimes New Roman\an3\fs11\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HEEEBEC&\clip(1,24,640,33)\t(0,7217,\clip(1,24,640,74))\pos(148,74)}Three, KI shall not engage in \Nany physical contact with YT,\Nincluding hugging, kissing,\Nand/or any sexual conduct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.23,0:05:31.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Three, KI shall not engage in \Nany physical contact with YT,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:35.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,including hugging, kissing, \Nand/or any sexual conduct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:37.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,However, this will not apply \Nto unintentional contact,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:38.58,top,SHUN,0,0,0,,Huh? Is the Prince always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.93,0:05:40.70,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,such as accidentally \Ntouching someone's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:40.28,top,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Yeah, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:43.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Furthermore, if either KI or YT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:47.21,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,develops romantic feelings \Nfor a separate third party,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.21,0:05:50.10,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,either may immediately \Nterminate this contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.47,0:05:52.30,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.43,0:05:54.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:57.66,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You said you were gonna think it over,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:05:59.79,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,so I'd figured you would just call it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:04.51,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Honestly, I considered that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:09.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But I hate to give up on something \Nwithout seeing it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.64,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:17.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,After all that,\NI'm allowed to date a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:19.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Starting out normal would be no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:23.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I shall do my best not to get\Ncut off during the cooling-off period.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:27.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The same. I look forward to it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.55,0:06:29.97,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What, is a battle about to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:34.37,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:35.74,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:36.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:40.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I have something I need to \Ndiscuss with Yoi-chan, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.75,0:06:41.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:44.98,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:46.53,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Then let us leave the young ones to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:47.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,H-Hey, wai—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.77,0:06:51.14,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What do you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:52.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:55.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?! Then why did you keep me behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:58.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Because I wanted some alone time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.31,0:07:01.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Listen here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:05.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But you're mine now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:08.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I can keep you all to myself, can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:12.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,N-No, this is precisely what I mentioned \Nin the contract a second ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:13.28,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.28,0:07:15.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Isn't this platonic contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:22.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I have to say, you seem \Nincredibly possessive, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:25.23,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's a bit far from your image,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.41,0:07:28.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Possessive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:32.28,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That's a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:34.76,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:40.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Actually, this might be the first time\NI've ever really wanted something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:44.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? What... do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.44,0:07:51.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I actually forgot what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:54.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, this guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.15,0:07:57.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Just in case, could you please \Ngive me your contact information?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:07:59.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:02.44,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Are you a suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The setup is a pain, don't ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.77,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?! Th-The bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.42,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:12.79,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:14.52,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How about today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wanna walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:22.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,N-No... It'd be bad if word got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:23.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:27.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay, if anything comes up let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.06,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wanna walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:39.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Wow. Words like that just \Nroll off his tongue, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:45.83,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,While I'm flustered just\Nat the thought of dating a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:52.76,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I mean... he'd be my very first \Nboyfriend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:53.80,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Technically...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:57.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan! Yoi-chan! Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:01.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Am I okay? Did I really make \Nthe right choice choosing him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:03.60,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Am I gradually becoming \Nnumb to all this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:09.36,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,437)\t(4803,5240,\3c&HFFFFFF&)\t(4803,5240,\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Actually, this might be the first time\NI've ever really wanted something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:13.82,Default,STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,Gyoza for two coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:15.85,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Yay! Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:16.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:17.16,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.41,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Is it your mom again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:20.66,top,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Aw, gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:20.66,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:24.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,My bad. Just got taken by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.65,0:09:27.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I sent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:31.95,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Things like "meant to be"\Nor "fate" or "Prince"...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.48,0:09:35.38,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an7\c&HFFFFFF&\t(3465,4466,\c&H3D3F41&)\3c&HF8FBFA&\fs15\pos(15,20)}Good evening.\NThis is my first time messaging.\NIt's Takiguichi.\NAfter thinking a little on what we\Nspoke about today, I would like to \Npropose the following:\NHow about a date next Saturday \Nor Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:35.38,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H20&\c&H826EDA&\t(3465,4466,\c&HF5F7F9&)}m 0 0 l 220 0 220 57 0 57
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.90,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,You have to determine \Nthose things for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:37.66,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Is she for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:46.94,Default,PASSERBYS,0,0,0,,What? Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:48.90,Default,PASSERBYS,0,0,0,,Handsome, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.91,Default,PASSERBYS,0,0,0,,Man, what a hottie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:52.86,Default,GIRL A,0,0,0,,That guy's hot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:54.97,top,GIRL B,0,0,0,,But they're wearing a skirt, \Nso they might be a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:56.99,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Maybe arriving thirty minutes \Nearly was a bit much...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:56.99,top,GIRL A,0,0,0,,Wow! She's really hot, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:10:00.33,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I mean, it was okay to ask him out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:02.69,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Was I too eager?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.69,0:10:06.29,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But this is really the only \Nway to see if we're compatible...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:08.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The one thing that bothers me is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:09.96,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fade(134,0)\c&H363C3F&\bord0\frz19.43\move(407,256.667,407,238,0,1320)}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:14.96,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,638)\t(2192,2830,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}His reply was unexpectedly dismissive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:18.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I thought he'd be more forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:19.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.65,0:10:23.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:27.08,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:30.18,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm just starting to \Nget super nervous now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.65,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously though, you're here \Nway ahead of schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:33.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you might be,\Nso I'm glad I got here early.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:35.11,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:36.84,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Also, why are you in your uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:40.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I had something to do at \Nschool before coming here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:41.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:42.84,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:46.47,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't admit that I was \Nagonizing over what to wear
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.47,0:10:49.08,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,before finally defaulting to \Nmy school uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:51.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You have some place you wanna hit today?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:54.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? No, I just figured we'd be \Ngoing to the movies or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:55.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,How about you, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Me? I've got no plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:01.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then, why don't we go look at clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:04.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What? No, I'm not really into...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:07.52,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Honestly, I really want to \Nsee you in all kinds of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:09.97,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,To the movies, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:10.37,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fade(52,159)\fnImpact\b1\bord0.5\c&H5E5ABE&\3c&H4C4C55&\t(0,636,\fs32)\frz8.266\pos(300.667,123.334)}Grab
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:15.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,H-Hey, um, the movies...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.21,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't worry, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:17.88,Default,STORE CLERK A,0,0,0,,Y-You look wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.94,0:11:21.86,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:25.62,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,This wasn't the kind of store I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:29.66,Default,STORE CLERK B,0,0,0,,Wow! That looks great on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:34.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Yoi-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously?! It looks {\i1}real{\i0} good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.53,0:11:37.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:40.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, face this way a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:45.80,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's so weird... Why can't \NI look Senpai in the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:49.18,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And anyway, why are you \Ngetting dressed, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:51.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm? Oh, you mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:53.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I was thinking I'd match your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:54.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:00.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I mean, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:04.46,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't we look good together like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:10.12,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh... The shoulder, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:12.73,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:17.96,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Normally, girls try on cuter clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:21.05,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,and if you're going to match, \Nit'd be matching couple clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:24.76,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But right now, my clothes don't look\Nlike what you'd wear on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:31.59,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Darn it... I don't know why, but the \Nshoulder he touched feels so tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:36.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And... you're just gonna go back \Nto what you were wearing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:38.12,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The sticker shock was too much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:40.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay not buying it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:42.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes! I don't need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:45.33,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Spoiled rich kids are just so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:47.62,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\c&H3870AA&\3c&H1A2735&\t(0,480,\fs13)\frx0\fry10\frz1.207\move(68.667,77.334,83.334,78.666,0,480)}Brown Sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:47.62,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\c&H3870AA&\3c&H1A2735&\frx352\fry18\frz2.29\t(0,480,\fs13)\move(68.001,318,84.667,283.333,0,400)}Warabi Mochi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:49.83,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs13\c&H3870AA&\3c&H1A2735&\frx0\fry10\frz1.207\t(0,2210,\fs12)\move(83.334,78.666,88.667,79.333,21,2210)}Brown Sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:49.83,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs13\c&H3870AA&\3c&H1A2735&\frx352\fry18\frz2.29\t(0,2210,\fs12)\move(84.667,283.333,90,275.333,0,2210)}Warabi Mochi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.07,0:12:52.10,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? A Japanese confectionery?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:53.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan, you like sweet things?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:56.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, not particularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.09,0:12:59.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, why not? I was starting \Nto get a bit hungry anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:01.00,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs8\t(0,1710,\7.5)\c&H58626A&\3c&HDFE5E8&\frz11.04\frx4\fry12\move(84.002,86.666,135.666,77.666,30,1698)}Apricot\NJam
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:01.00,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs13\t(0,1710,\fs12.5)\c&H58626A&\3c&HDFE5E8&\frx346\fry28\frz20.1\move(223.002,326,262.332,295.667,30,1698)}Bean Daifuku
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:01.00,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs8\t(0,1710,\fs7.5)\c&H58626A&\3c&HDFE5E8&\frz279.6\frx358\fry26\move(453.334,238,469.999,215.333,0,1698)}Lemon Daifuku
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:02.46,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fnComic Sans MS\fs9\c&H44535C&\t(0,1460,\fs10)\frz48.83\frx356\fry4\move(253.333,190,248,192,0,1448)}Moon Viewing\NRabbit Manju
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:07.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I want the mitarashi dango. \NHow about you, Yoi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.87,0:13:10.39,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hmm... What should I choose...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.55,0:13:14.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, shall we eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.47,0:13:15.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:18.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:19.58,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:22.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The red bean paste in the \Ndaifuku is the smooth kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:22.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.94,0:13:25.82,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Is there really a difference \Nbetween the clumpy and smooth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.82,0:13:28.10,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,There sure is! They're totally different!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:31.65,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The clumpy kind isn't bad, but \Nwhen you eat mochi and such,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.65,0:13:34.04,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,don't you feel a bit let down \Nwhen it's not the smooth kind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:36.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No, it's never crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:38.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, it's completely out of the question!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:41.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The texture and mouthfeel\Nare completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:44.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, you really like \Nsweet things, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:46.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,N-No more than most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:47.91,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then what's your favorite snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:50.97,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Choco anpan, oreos, and \NAlfort chocolate cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:52.35,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What do you put on your toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:53.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Butter and condensed milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:55.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You've got a serious sweet tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:57.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Do... Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.93,0:14:01.94,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Not even aware of it, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:03.86,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:08.03,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The corners of his mouth\Nlift up so beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:12.24,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,When he smiles, he looks so kind. \NLike a completely different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:17.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I feel like... I really learned something \Nabout Senpai for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.68,0:14:22.79,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We can probably do one more place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:24.92,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm... Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:34.85,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\bord1.5\fs20\c&H101927&\3c&H324158&}Flower Garden
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:28.99,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,An amusement park?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:31.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But it's almost closing time, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:34.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah. We won't stay long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.74,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Wasn't... expecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:47.31,Default,STAFF,0,0,0,,Okay then, off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:54.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:14:59.96,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I really like amusement parks at \Nnight just before they close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:02.83,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's beautiful, but vaguely melancholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:05.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I like fireworks in the winter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:07.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, I know that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:09.30,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Ice cream tastes better \Nin the winter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,See? I knew you liked sweet stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.63,0:15:13.68,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:19.72,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We often know ourselves the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:26.73,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Today, he's less "Senpai" and more \N"Kohaku Ichimura"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:29.22,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Do you always...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.21,0:15:32.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,go on dates like these?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.10,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh. No, this is a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.88,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I usually just go wherever \Nthe other person wants to go
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:39.91,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,and go along with their vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:45.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't have any desire \Nto any particular thing with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.19,0:15:48.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Even the clothing store was a first for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.27,0:15:50.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.07,0:15:51.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I assumed you knew about\Nthat sort of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.98,0:15:53.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:56.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm always just wearing whatever \Nan acquaintance gives me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:57.91,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What kind of acquaintance is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.65,0:15:59.42,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:03.95,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Today was super fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:06.15,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:12.25,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai's profile, illuminated \Nfrom the lights, was so beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:15.90,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I couldn't take my eyes off of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:22.96,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,From the way you messaged me, \NI thought I was bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:25.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? I sent you a reply, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:27.79,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It felt incredibly dismissive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.23,0:16:35.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I... usually leave messages \Nlike that on read, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:38.35,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I wanted to reply to yours immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:41.31,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,even if it wasn't much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:47.63,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fade(134,0)\c&H717778&\bord0\frz19.43\pos(291.333,236.667)}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:52.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,O-Oh, I... see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:53.58,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:08.99,Default,STAFF,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:11.05,Default,STAFF,0,0,0,,All right, I'll open the door now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.91,0:17:15.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well then... Let's head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:20.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:29.98,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Are we really going home already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:33.07,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I wanted to reply to yours immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:38.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Going home right now \Nseems like a waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:39.42,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:41.58,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wanna grab something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.58,0:17:43.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh, oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:45.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay, what're ya feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:47.45,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Uh, I can't think of anything \Nwhen you ask me like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.97,0:17:48.05,top,PASSERBY A,0,0,0,,I'm serious, it's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:49.65,Default,PASSERBY A,0,0,0,,There's a super delicious gyoza place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:52.46,Default,PASSERBY B,0,0,0,,Since the gyoza king has spoken, \NI guess we'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:55.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Gyoza sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:56.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Let's follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:57.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.31,0:18:02.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously, it's pretty badass, \Nending a first date with gyoza.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:07.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.08,0:18:10.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:13.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,They're short-staffed at work, \Nand asked me to come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:15.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:16.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:18.73,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine. No prob.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:21.00,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then let's call it a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:25.90,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I really... wanted to eat gyoza.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:33.75,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\b1\fnComic Sans MS\bord0\c&HA8A8A8&\frz16.68\move(294,258.334,294,-10,0,6630)\frx342\fry42}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:30.21,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for \Ngoing out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:32.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:34.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're the one who invited me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:35.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:36.46,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:39.51,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,If you'd like...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:41.43,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,you can eat at our place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:43.08,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.17,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi, you're finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:46.85,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Ugh! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:49.35,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Huh? Aren't you the one \Nfrom the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:50.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:52.47,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.47,0:18:55.23,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Are you two actually {\i1}going out{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.77,0:18:56.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,D-Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:58.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, we actually are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:02.12,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,What, no way!\NThen he's your first boyfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:04.83,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Yoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:04.83,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:06.74,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey! What about\N Yoi made you like her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:11.48,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Come on! Hurry up and get back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.14,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:13.89,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Come on, your dad wants to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:15.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,In all honesty, her looks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:21.20,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know, if I go out with her, \NI can look at her all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:23.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So I guess I wanted the right to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:26.26,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, that just about covers it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:29.84,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,What a unique kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.57,0:19:29.84,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Let's go, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:32.62,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Huh? But I still haven't \Nintroduced myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:32.62,top,YOI,0,0,0,,You don't need to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:34.03,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:35.15,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:43.86,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You're laughing too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:44.68,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:47.31,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,C'mon, the right to look at her all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.31,0:19:48.84,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,The Prince is such a stalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.84,0:19:50.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, it's just downright scary!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.71,0:19:54.79,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\b1\blur1\bord0\fs12\c&H3E483C&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz274.9\frx10\fry12\pos(392.667,196.001)}Green Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.71,0:19:54.79,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\b1\blur2\bord1\fs12\1aFF\c&H3E483C&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz274.9\frx10\fry12\pos(392.667,196.001)}Green Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.97,0:19:54.79,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I was having so much fun,\Nand it was ruined in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:55.79,Default,KOTOBUKI; NOBARA,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:57.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:20:00.54,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Yoi just said she had \N"fun" with the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:01.34,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:04.14,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, no, this is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:07.50,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's really not like that, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.05,0:20:13.23,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But... it really was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:16.57,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh my, {\i1}oh my{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:18.85,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Just make it official already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.85,0:20:22.70,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,N-No, I mean... Yes, it was fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.19,0:20:25.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,but we still don't know if \Nthat's love or not, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:27.58,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, that just about covers it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:31.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:33.75,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Before considering what's \N"fate" and "meant to be,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:36.67,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I don't know if this is even "love."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:40.91,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.91,0:20:43.98,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,You're always making the Prince \Nangry, aren't you, Ichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:50.85,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Ugh, I hate chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:53.09,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Today might be a rough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:20:54.11,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:20:59.56,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You know, chemistry is human wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:00.48,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.69,0:21:05.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:09.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Y-You scared me! What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:11.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Why don't you just approach \Nme the normal way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:14.12,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're the one who said not to come \Nto your classroom anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.17,0:21:17.41,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Also, why are you ignoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.91,0:21:19.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Did I upset you again somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.09,0:21:25.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,B-Because... You told my dad\N all about us dating, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:29.64,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? We weren't at school, so it \Ndoesn't have to be a secret, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:31.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.63,0:21:34.77,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,there's a chance that we \Nmight not be dating, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:37.95,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wha... There is? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:40.23,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:44.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,When it comes to love,\Nyou can't get into a relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:46.70,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,unless at least one \Nperson likes the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.09,0:21:51.86,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But all you say is,\N"I want to watch you forever"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.86,0:21:54.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,or, "Show me what kind of face \Nyou'll make next" and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:21:59.42,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Is that actually "love?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:15.41,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(634,250)\fs18\c&H3C2231&\bord0\b1\fnComic Sans MS\t(4970,5387,\c&HFFFFFF&)\frz19.29\pos(342.667,211.999)}Unawareness
